8. currently attending or has completed a rehabilitation programme targeting balance and/or dizziness in the past year or is currently part of a clinical trial testing a medicinal product. These factors may skew both the assessment scores and treatment outcome and for this reason they are listed as exclusion criteria; and
9. lack of a good grasp of written/spoken English will be excluded. The latter due to the need to complete multiple questionnaires and the lack of funding for interpreters.

